{"sba-hinata-32347":{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n こんにちは‪⸜(*ˊᵕˋ*)⸝‬\n \n 佐々木のみーぱんです！！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38VVA0ED79299R3RQ38S1C","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38VW9A5ERDVV39EFP2B8T4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 昨日、一昨日は個別握手会がありました！😆\n \n 来てくださったみなさん、ありがとうございました\n \n \n \n \n \n 今年もよろしくお願いします😊\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n そしてね、一昨日に生誕祭を開いて頂きました😊\n \n 一年以上なのかな？そんだけ時間をかけて、この会を開いてくださって本当にありがとうございます！！\n \n \n \n \n 私のために、こんなに色々考えてくれていることが凄く嬉しいです！！！\n \n \n \n まだまだ写真沢山撮ってるので、待っててください🥰\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n この会を開いてくださった生誕委員のみなさん、そして祝ってくださったみなさん！\n \n ありがとうございます😊😊\n \n \n すごく嬉しかったです！！\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38VX7X91XQG7V7BMN7K941","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38VYF2C5GFN6XBAHM85C8W","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38VZF0G9ZEWTVN5ZR8V8EE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38W0DWAH0162VS1SZPV1ZH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 🍞は幸せです〜😳😆\n \n \n \n \n \n \n 🍞佐々木美玲🍞"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-32736":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずはMステでの「きっかけ」初披露"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピアノ生演奏させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意外にも活動でピアノ弾くのは今年初だったので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々ド緊張だった〜>_<"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Mステでのピアノは3回目。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもやりがいがあって嬉しい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"贅沢にもVTRまで作っていただいて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"席が大原櫻子ちゃんと隣で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんお話させていただきましたっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とてもフレンドリーで明るくて素敵(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お互い楽器をやっているので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかコラボできたらいいな〜なんて思いました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくださったみなさんありがとです<(_ _*)>"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日、46時間TV無事おわりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てくださったみなさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー、そして何よりスタッフの皆さま"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にお疲れさまでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずオープニングアクトではフィンランド民謡を"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現地の方と歌わせていただきました☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2016/06/12/3739267/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左からミカエル、エリカ、シニッカ、ミンナ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良くなれて、フィンランドぜひ来て〜とか色々お話伺えたよっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年100周年だし行きたーい(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お三人と、協力してくださったフィンランド大使館の方"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"br